Description: Calculate general biodiversity indicators from GBIF data
    cubes. Includes many common indicators such as species richness,
    evenness, and completeness, which can be calculated over time (trends)
    or space (maps). Now also supports retaining original cell IDs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
